  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action for Ocean - Africa Fair Seaweed Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action for Ocean drives sustainable growth in East Africa&#x2019;s seaweed industry, focusing on women&#x2019;s and youths&#x2019; access to finance, knowledge, and markets. By providing training, toolkits, and &#x201c;seaweed-farm-in-a-box&#x201d; solutions, it enhances productivity and economic opportunities for coastal communities. Partnering with NGOs, it scales a &#x201c;Seaweed-Farm-as-a-Service&#x201d; model to boost livelihoods, marine conservation, and carbon sequestration. Aligning with SDGs on poverty, gender equality, and marine sustainability, the initiative strengthens coastal resilience and promotes inclusive, sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
